'''Cumulus Gallus''' (超翼獣ピヨルーツ, ''Chō Yokujū Piyorūtsu'', '''Super Winged Beast Piyoroots''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of [[Chickful A]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]].

