==Trivia==
*Cumulus Gallus' name is derived from ''cumulus'' (a puffy, low-level cloud) and ''gallus'' (Latin for rooster). It may also be a pun on ''cumulonimbus'' (a dense, towering cloud associated with rainfall and lightning).
*Cumulus Gallus has the same personality, branching horns, wings, eye color, feather color, lightning-producing capabilities and habitat (a [[wikia:monsterhunter:Tower|tower]] that extends above the clouds) as [[wikia:monsterhunter:White Fatalis|White Fatalis]], an [[wikia:monsterhunter:Elder Dragon|Elder Dragon]] in the ''Monster Hunter'' franchise. Both also grow stronger after falling below a certain amount of health.
**Cumulus Gallus' Japanese name, ピヨルーツ ''Piyorūtsu'' ("Piyoroots"), is a portmanteau of ピヨピヨ ''piyopiyo'' (an onomatopoeia for chirping) and the Japanese name of the White Fatalis Armors, ミラルーツ ''Mirarūtsu'' ("Miraroots"), which is commonly used as a nickname for White Fatalis itself in Japan.
*Since it's described as both ancestral and violent, Cumulus Gallus could potentially be the grandmother of [[Chickful A]], whose Japanese description says, "Her hair-trigger temper is inherited from her grandmother."

